<title>MEXICO: Contal proposes share split.</title>
<headline>Contal proposes share split.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board at Mexican soft drinks bottler Grupo Continental (Contal) will propose a share split to its shareholders, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A call for an extraordinary shareholders assembly by Contal said the board will propose a split by &quot;issuing 2.5 new shares for each current outstanding share.&quot;</p>
<p>The assembly will take place on April 17.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey bureau +528 345-7617))</p>
</text>
